{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Amend your actions.\u00a0Restore the Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elements have gone wild and the world is now in danger. Driven by guilt, you embark on a journey to restore them all and conquer the temples where each Element resides. Solve puzzles, fight foes and find secrets using the Elements you've gathered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304280/extras/d538649ac841a969580b08e889445980.poster.avif?t=1776186041\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304280/extras/d538649ac841a969580b08e889445980.webm?t=1776186041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304280/extras/d538649ac841a969580b08e889445980.mp4?t=1776186041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies using the Elements, alongside your sword and shield. Combine Fire, Water, Electricity, and more to exploit their weaknesses and overcome tough encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Temples</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your worth in the 8 unique temples, full of puzzles, secrets, dangerous foes and fun boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel and explore the 8 unique biomes. They are full of secrets, upgrades and inhabitants in need of your help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore the Elements and unlock their abilities to open up new locations, solve puzzles and access previously inaccessible areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome guilt</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story of self-discovery and the journey to heal a broken world and a broken self.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1304280?t=1776186041","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1304280?t=1776186041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304280/7bc2ede94b2f23ca294947eeb3942842b5578a2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776186041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304280/7bc2ede94b2f23ca294947eeb3942842b5578a2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776186041","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Amend your actions.\u00a0Restore the Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elements have gone wild and the world is now in danger. Driven by guilt, you embark on a journey to restore them all and conquer the temples where each Element resides. Solve puzzles, fight foes and find secrets using the Elements you've gathered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304280/extras/d538649ac841a969580b08e889445980.poster.avif?t=1776186041\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304280/extras/d538649ac841a969580b08e889445980.webm?t=1776186041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304280/extras/d538649ac841a969580b08e889445980.mp4?t=1776186041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies using the Elements, alongside your sword and shield. Combine Fire, Water, Electricity, and more to exploit their weaknesses and overcome tough encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Temples</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your worth in the 8 unique temples, full of puzzles, secrets, dangerous foes and fun boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel and explore the 8 unique biomes. They are full of secrets, upgrades and inhabitants in need of your help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore the Elements and unlock their abilities to open up new locations, solve puzzles and access previously inaccessible areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome guilt</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story of self-discovery and the journey to heal a broken world and a broken self.</p></li></ul>","developers":["AnKae Games"],"dlc":[4449270],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304280/9987c6d1cd376f6cd46a50bb3b93311919476872/header.jpg?t=1776186041","is_fr